Third-party material bundled with mmdc (Rust)
=============================================

The code in this repository is covered by LICENSE.txt. The following assets are
included under their own licenses; the license texts are in LICENSES/.


Font Awesome Free 7.3.1
-----------------------

  assets/fontawesome/icons.bin   (compiled in with the `icons` cargo feature)

  Font Awesome Free by Fonticons, Inc. (https://fontawesome.com)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Fonticons, Inc.
  Source: the npm package @fortawesome/fontawesome-free@7.3.1
  License: https://fontawesome.com/license/free
    Icons: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt
    Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (with Reserved Font Name "Font Awesome")
    Code:  MIT License
  The package's own license file is LICENSES/FontAwesome-Free-LICENSE.txt
  (it includes the full SIL Open Font License 1.1).

  Changes: the icon outlines from the package's svgs/{solid,regular,brands}
  directories and the class names (with aliases) from its css/fontawesome.css
  and css/brands.css were re-encoded into a compact binary file by
  tools/gen_fa_icons.py; the shapes themselves are unchanged. The file also
  holds the `.notdef` outline of each of the package's three web fonts
  (webfonts/fa-*.woff2, SIL OFL 1.1), drawn where the browser would show it.
  No font file is included.


Recursive 1.085 (Recursive Variable)
------------------------------------

  assets/fonts/recursive-400.ttf
  assets/fonts/recursive-700.ttf
  assets/fonts/recursive-400-italic.ttf
  assets/fonts/recursive-700-italic.ttf
  (compiled in with the `fonts` cargo feature; their metrics are also in
  src/text/webfont_data.rs, compiled in always)

  Recursive by The Recursive Project Authors (github.com/arrowtype/recursive)
  Copyright 2019 The Recursive Project Authors
  Source: the npm package @fontsource-variable/recursive@5.3.0 (its `wght`
  subsets, files/recursive-*-wght-normal.woff2), which mermaid-cli loads
  License: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (no Reserved Font Name):
           LICENSES/Recursive-OFL-1.1.txt (the package's own LICENSE file)

  Changes (tools/gen_bundled_fonts.py): the latin, latin-ext, vietnamese and
  cyrillic-ext subsets instanced at wght 400 and 700, merged into one font per
  weight, hinting dropped, and named "Recursive Variable" (the family name the
  package's CSS gives them); the Italic files are those outlines slanted by a
  quarter of their height (the oblique a browser synthesises for this upright
  face). The metric tables in src/text/webfont_data.rs are generated from the
  package's files by tools/gen_font_tables.py.


